{"id": "sevt_01K9yGxTy58xdxg6zS4NWLz7", "content": [{"text": "`510eca7` is just a log-formatting change (red herring \u2014 rolled back, didn't help). `07000f4` is the classic N+1: the batch `order_id__in` query was replaced with a per-order query in a loop. db_pool_utilization climbs steadily from 14:08 and saturates at 1.0 by 14:39. Let me confirm in the log.", "type": "text"}], "processed_at": "2026-10-14T05:49:11.748121Z", "type": "agent.message"}
